# Hand-maintained policy input: modules that are LEGITIMATELY toolchain
# providers, and therefore exempt from D2.
#
# Being a toolchain implementation is the module's stated purpose — registering
# is what it is for. Everything else registering a non-dev toolchain is imposing
# it on every transitive consumer, usually by accident.
#
# This is deliberately a small, reviewable allowlist rather than a heuristic in
# the query: an exemption should require someone to write the module's name down.
@prefix gate: <https://tbzl.dev/ns/gate#> .

<https://tbzl.dev/m/rules_jena/0.3.2> gate:declaredToolchainProvider true .
